    "atom::7199bd6117295d60e2e20818": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7199bd6117295d60e2e20818",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "1. 临床队列：选取MET4-IO试验中接受MET4+ICI联合治疗的患者（n=23有配对样本），分为MET4组、ICI对照组、高/低IgG反应者亚组及定植成功/失败亚组。 2. 抗体检测：使用CFSE标记MET4细菌，与不同稀释度的患者血浆孵育，通过流式细胞术检测IgA和IgG的结合强度（MFI）和频率，计算响应指数（RI）。 3. 菌群分析：对治疗前后粪便进行宏基因组测序，分析整体菌群多样性及MET4特定菌株的相对丰度变化；对经流式分选的IgG结合/未结合细菌组分进行16S rRNA测序，鉴定被抗体结合的特定菌种。 4. 免疫表型分析：利用质谱流式细胞术（CyTOF）对PBMCs进行多参数分析，比较不同IgG反应组别在治疗前后免疫细胞亚群（如B细胞、CD4+ T细胞、单核细胞等）的频率变化。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8ebc5ee47e8a182be307413de47dc880320d66bfc6abfaf6ab1820e3c9281a2f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::88c3d7422c083be143d6c7c7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::88c3d7422c083be143d6c7c7",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "证实了口服细菌联合体MET4能在人体中诱导特异性的全身性IgG免疫反应，且该反应与特定有益菌的丰度增加及免疫细胞亚群的重塑相关。",
        "limits": "1. 早期阶段试验，样本量小（仅23例配对分析），统计效力不足，无法得出关于临床疗效（如生存期、肿瘤缩小）的结论。 2. 存在多种肿瘤类型混杂因素。 3. 抗体检测方法在处理复杂微生物群落时可能存在保留率偏差（Type II error风险），导致某些菌种的抗体反应被低估。 4. 未能直接证明诱导的抗体具有抗肿瘤功能，仅作为系统性免疫激活的标志物。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4967fdcc69372073f1a7ade9e078551ccf2d8ab44db245ca157efd04c2aec46c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8a9048b4f7faa99ae05b0687": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8a9048b4f7faa99ae05b0687",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "MET4治疗组 vs ICI对照组",
        "finding": "MET4治疗显著提高了循环抗MET4 IgG的反应强度和频率，而IgA无显著变化；总血浆IgG浓度在各组间无差异。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::884cc470947a6c4ca0b809681ca849f65981f4285ddf55478f600e5e6d6261ad",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ac8729af8b35f74e846875eb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ac8729af8b35f74e846875eb",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "高IgG反应者（RI>3, n=5）vs 其他组",
        "finding": "高IgG反应者表现出更高的肠道菌群Shannon多样性增加，且特定MET4菌株（如C. aerofaciens, B. adolescentis）的相对丰度增加更显著。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::884cc470947a6c4ca0b809681ca849f65981f4285ddf55478f600e5e6d6261ad",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::085f047b2dfff42aa898e3c2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::085f047b2dfff42aa898e3c2",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "IgG结合组分分析",
        "finding": "尽管C. aerofaciens等菌在粪便中丰度增加并与高IgG相关，但它们并未在IgG结合的细菌组分中富集；相反，Acidaminococcus在IgG结合组分中显著富集，尽管其整体定植效果有限。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::884cc470947a6c4ca0b809681ca849f65981f4285ddf55478f600e5e6d6261ad",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::017b5e3aa522884b5f3d2b79": {
      "atom_id": "atom::017b5e3aa522884b5f3d2b79",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "外周血免疫亚群变化",
        "finding": "高IgG反应者在MET4治疗后显示出循环B细胞和FoxP3+ CD4+ T细胞的显著增加，以及CD14+和CD16+单核细胞的减少；这些变化在治疗前不存在。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::884cc470947a6c4ca0b809681ca849f65981f4285ddf55478f600e5e6d6261ad",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ad2edab2bba30c1a1111dafc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ad2edab2bba30c1a1111dafc",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "empirical",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a08290505c03589cb2e02f5daf1a844b4a01f4fcfdd4fc8fcf14f0118a5dcaec",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d6aa4c7c10f6272b2fbe4e28": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d6aa4c7c10f6272b2fbe4e28",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "1. MET4细菌联合体能否在接受ICI治疗的实体瘤患者中诱导特异性的循环抗体反应？2. 这种抗体反应是否与肠道内MET4菌株的定植（engraftment）或特定菌属丰度的变化相关？3. 特异性抗体反应是否与外周血中免疫细胞亚群（如B细胞、T细胞、单核细胞）的分布变化有关联？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::48ef9ece6a9bf819e4d3c07db9d7003a4410688a0b86c0edc3e97cf42e7e8fa2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::baffeb683c983156110161c3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::baffeb683c983156110161c3",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "针对晚期实体瘤患者，研究在免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗背景下，口服细菌联合体MET4对系统性免疫反应的影响。研究对象为MET4-IO临床试验队列B中的30名ICI初治患者，分析样本包括治疗前后的血浆、外周血单个核细胞（PBMCs）和粪便。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c6ff25e7072218bd8aea1ad0a13ca21a0d0a3351274827d08956b2d7b25fb7bb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f6c73b08080a9cd312b52c64": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f6c73b08080a9cd312b52c64",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在评估新型微生物疗法MET4是否能诱导特异性的全身性体液免疫反应，并探索其与肠道菌群定植及循环免疫亚群变化的关联。研究利用抗微生物抗体流式细胞术检测血浆中针对MET4的IgG/IgA反应，结合宏基因组测序分析粪便菌群变化，并通过质谱流式细胞术评估PBMCs中免疫细胞亚群的动态变化。结果显示，MET4治疗显著提高了部分患者的抗MET4 IgG水平，高IgG反应者与特定有益菌（如Collinsella aerofaciens）丰度增加及B细胞、调节性T细胞增多相关，但IgG主要结合的对象并非这些定植成功的菌种，提示可能存在异源免疫刺激机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7fb7bb6fed6b83f6a39123310135a6828733f6b935f36b2143f152ac966326ee",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::650c5a3dcd556d6992952683": {
      "atom_id": "atom::650c5a3dcd556d6992952683",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了微生物疗法（特别是细菌联合体）诱导宿主全身性体液免疫反应的实证数据。它揭示了“定植成功的菌”与“被抗体识别的菌”可能不一致的现象，提出了“佐剂样菌”触发异源免疫反应的假说，并为理解肠道菌群如何通过改变外周免疫细胞库来影响ICI疗效提供了具体的细胞学证据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3759d99a2ca81548fee4b4d19fac2dc9756f07021aedd29e6d29d8f0bc4b4636",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::95758ded15cecd4e3d7edfe7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::95758ded15cecd4e3d7edfe7",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅针对MET4这一特定联合体，且为早期安全性/定植试验，非疗效确证性试验。",
        "contribution": "提供了细菌联合体干预后，宿主产生特异性循环抗体的量化数据（RI指数、MFI变化），并展示了高反应者与特定菌群（C. aerofaciens等）丰度增加的关联。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::88577cbb76de057706812d8b47880f5eec3595d77a5b96eb6514c2c19eb25a1b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fb4890646106a09dd89ebbe5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fb4890646106a09dd89ebbe5",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中论证微生物疗法可诱导系统性免疫记忆/反应，以及菌群组成变化与宿主免疫状态的相关性。可作为“微生物干预引发宿主适应性免疫”的具体案例。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::52ea6858c2fe5421907b95cb9c3ccb7bfd616552f78d674bce08fa26e3dc8cc3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::469f4cbdeb5bc3ad719bb7a4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::469f4cbdeb5bc3ad719bb7a4",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制为相关性观察，非因果验证；体外结合实验不能完全代表体内功能；质谱流式面板有限，未涵盖所有免疫亚群。",
        "contribution": "通过IgG结合分选和16S测序，发现抗体主要结合Acidaminococcus而非丰度增加的C. aerofaciens，提出“定植菌作为佐剂激发针对其他菌或自身成分的异源抗体反应”的机制假说。同时记录了高IgG反应者外周B细胞和FoxP3+ T细胞增加、单核细胞减少的免疫重塑现象。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::88577cbb76de057706812d8b47880f5eec3595d77a5b96eb6514c2c19eb25a1b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8aa8cb2c33d61f8ec1dd2bfe": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8aa8cb2c33d61f8ec1dd2bfe",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于探讨MIC介导ICI疗效的可能机制之一：即微生物不仅通过局部作用，还通过激发全身性体液和细胞免疫网络发挥作用。可用于解释为何某些菌虽未大量定植却能引发强免疫反应，或为何不同个体对同一疗法的免疫反应差异巨大。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::52ea6858c2fe5421907b95cb9c3ccb7bfd616552f78d674bce08fa26e3dc8cc3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3e1080a999c057765ab89992": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3e1080a999c057765ab89992",
      "source_handle": "P0122",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "介绍了抗微生物抗体流式细胞术的具体操作流程（CFSE标记、血浆稀释、二级抗体染色）及质谱流式在免疫亚群分析中的应用。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::73efa1be4be250cf312dbe783dc8f3712f715ee79db5c885e78434ea239597d8",
          "field_path": [
