    "atom::b37713eabcf85e9c66591d0b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b37713eabcf85e9c66591d0b",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述（Review）。作者通过梳理现有文献，系统阐述了肠道微生物组与宿主免疫系统之间的相互作用机制，重点分析了特定微生物物种、代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸）以及菌群失调对抗PD-1免疫治疗疗效的影响。文章进一步归纳了基于微生物组的干预策略，包括粪便微生物群移植（FMT）、饮食干预和益生菌使用，并讨论了其在黑色素瘤治疗中的潜力与挑战。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3a738e1dd0c22503e3f7f80b5c262130ed756cfad1a939164c4aa1063f0a551d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::76dfb64da820177736fc01a2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::76dfb64da820177736fc01a2",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "综合了肠道微生物组影响抗PD-1疗法疗效的多种机制，包括T细胞激活、代谢物调节及免疫检查点表达调控；汇总了FMT、饮食和益生菌等干预策略的临床前及早期临床研究证据；明确了特定菌种（如Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium）和菌群多样性作为预测生物标志物的潜在价值。",
        "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究，未提供新的实验数据或独立验证；对于不同干预策略的有效性和安全性比较缺乏直接的头对头证据；部分机制（如具体菌株与免疫细胞的精确分子通路）仍基于动物模型或小型临床试验，外推至所有实体瘤存在不确定性；摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及质量评估方法。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e5778996a71761979ad57050e136b72af830489c283416fed21a67ec7d3700b6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::24a88f39680af325af37ed0e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::24a88f39680af325af37ed0e",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "在黑色素瘤患者中，接受抗PD-1治疗且肠道菌群中含有特定有益菌（如Akkermansia muciniphila, Bifidobacterium）或具有高多样性的个体。",
        "finding": "这些患者表现出更好的治疗反应和生存获益，机制涉及增强CD8+ T细胞活化、增加肿瘤浸润及促进Th1/Th17分化。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1ff0957b835bc6eefacb9194385f3b91c037721d403f1355ba05a4b78d6b4732",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ee2882a0c098df37543578fe": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ee2882a0c098df37543578fe",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "肠道菌群失调（Dysbiosis），表现为有益菌减少、有害菌增多或多样性降低。",
        "finding": "与抗PD-1治疗耐药相关，机制包括调节性T细胞（Tregs）扩增、髓源性抑制细胞（MDSCs）作用增强以及效应T细胞向肿瘤微环境的浸润减少。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1ff0957b835bc6eefacb9194385f3b91c037721d403f1355ba05a4b78d6b4732",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fd1bd67acdf7b29fc150364f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fd1bd67acdf7b29fc150364f",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "使用粪便微生物群移植（FMT）将健康供体菌群转移至对免疫治疗耐药的黑色素瘤患者。",
        "finding": "Davari等人（2021）的研究显示，FMT可恢复有利的免疫环境，增强T细胞活化，使部分先前耐药的患者重新获得对PD-1阻断的反应。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1ff0957b835bc6eefacb9194385f3b91c037721d403f1355ba05a4b78d6b4732",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::bff9fb7c91d662c3d780bc09": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bff9fb7c91d662c3d780bc09",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "摄入富含纤维的饮食以支持短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）产生菌的生长。",
        "finding": "SCFAs（如丁酸、丙酸、乙酸）可通过抑制组蛋白去乙酰化酶（HDACs）和促进抗炎信号通路，增强抗肿瘤免疫反应，改善抗PD-1疗效。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1ff0957b835bc6eefacb9194385f3b91c037721d403f1355ba05a4b78d6b4732",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a623e8c61ed512d650536c49": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a623e8c61ed512d650536c49",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::48c883c0e2d72ea48142d9c2a0e8c2412d6ddf76f14884a4aca0c278f27b2ece",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8ab14efc6b30694f0585ce00": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8ab14efc6b30694f0585ce00",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管抗PD-1免疫疗法显著改善了黑色素瘤患者的生存率，但疗效存在高度异质性。本研究旨在探讨肠道微生物组如何调节这种疗效差异，阐明其背后的免疫学机制，并评估通过调节微生物组（如FMT、饮食、益生菌）来增强免疫治疗效果的潜在策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d878bb30732fec2f7903e6903b7e8691b467b30c41ceb9c33398777b9edafa4f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8628c3209fc51cc52f581364": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8628c3209fc51cc52f581364",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究对象为黑色素瘤患者的肠道微生物组及其与抗PD-1免疫治疗的相互作用。情境涵盖从基础免疫机制（T细胞激活、代谢物作用）到临床干预策略（FMT、饮食、益生菌）的多个层面。范围主要聚焦于黑色素瘤，但也提及对其他癌症的潜在启示。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::13d60ae31a32b7f867c3624ca9794d61e3501ed37a620c4f8d0c5088e8f7e80a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::683021d8eb786f400362468b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::683021d8eb786f400362468b",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本综述旨在解决抗PD-1免疫疗法在黑色素瘤治疗中疗效变异性大的问题。文章首先介绍了肠道微生物组在维持免疫稳态和启动抗肿瘤免疫中的核心作用，详细阐述了微生物通过直接接触（如GALT中的抗原呈递）和间接代谢产物（如SCFAs）调节宿主免疫系统的机制。随后，文章总结了与良好治疗反应相关的微生物特征（如高多样性、特定菌属丰度）以及与耐药相关的菌群失调状态。最后，综述评估了三种主要的微生物组干预策略：FMT在逆转耐药方面的初步成功、高纤维饮食对SCFA产生的促进作用，以及益生菌使用的潜在益处与安全风险。文章指出，理解并操纵微生物组有望实现更个性化的癌症免疫治疗，但仍需更多临床研究来优化方案并确保安全性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ac89914d87df4eba67dee496413923d78508cee3dfcd28fe9a7fff6f256a50b8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::81f9c034da2846de523e03a2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::81f9c034da2846de523e03a2",
      "source_handle": "P0250",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物组如何调节固体肿瘤（特别是黑色素瘤）对免疫检查点抑制剂（如抗PD-1）的疗效提供了全面的背景信息和机制解释。它系统地整理了微生物组组成、代谢产物与免疫反应之间的关联，并评估了FMT、饮食和益生菌等干预策略的潜力。对于综述而言，此文是构建微生物组-免疫治疗相互作用理论框架的重要素材，尤其适用于阐述机制细节和讨论潜在的治疗增强策略。然而，由于其综述性质和主要聚焦于黑色素瘤，其在推广到其他实体瘤或直接比较不同干预策略有效性方面的证据力度有限，需谨慎引用。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::c7c67d13abcc3ba3a71d2af4a15b829f6a4501c6bc00f3ac4ce151d51792125a",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3cf08f0e285317b141cb0d490b7b915270ecda23b3b3b88b9f1034f809069bd9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a8323f303ecbdef63bd0e6a2": {
