    "atom::ee50190613a56dd7cb60fb52": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ee50190613a56dd7cb60fb52",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "本研究采用文献综述的方法。作者检索并整理了近年来关于肠道微生物群与ICI疗效及毒性关系的研究，重点分析了不同癌症类型中响应者与无响应者/发生irAEs患者之间的微生物组成差异（基于16S rRNA测序和宏基因组测序数据）。文章通过表格汇总了各研究中涉及的细菌门类、属种及其与临床结局的关联，并归纳了相关的代谢机制和动物实验验证结果。最后，综述了FMT及其他微生态调节策略的临床应用现状、局限性及未来方向。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::26ee91a52e6177beade26280a39137d871f73690a5f87f50089202ebed1d3bd9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::63dddf9f60b735545758e10e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::63dddf9f60b735545758e10e",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "系统汇总了不同实体瘤中肠道微生物群与ICI疗效及irAEs关联的现有证据，提供了按癌症类型和微生物门类分类的详细参考表（Table 1, 2, 3, 4, 5），有助于识别潜在的生物标志物。",
        "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于所纳入研究的原始数据质量，而原始研究多为观察性队列，存在混杂因素（如饮食、抗生素使用）和方法学差异。文章未提供新的实验数据，对因果机制的解释主要基于作者对现有文献的综合推断，缺乏大规模前瞻性验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::710969563fc541f8b2ee2d975ce006c8ae7b217468bfa54a91745d878d23ce44",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::cad74e04b48d46bf9fabed2e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cad74e04b48d46bf9fabed2e",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "不同实体瘤类型（黑色素瘤、NSCLC、RCC、HCC等）",
        "finding": "厚壁菌门（Firmicutes）和放线菌门（Actinobacteria）中的某些菌种（如双歧杆菌、普拉梭菌）常与ICI疗效正相关；拟杆菌门（Bacteroidetes）的作用具有情境依赖性，部分情况下与疗效负相关或与irAEs相关；变形菌门（Proteobacteria）通常与无响应或较差预后相关；粘质沙雷氏菌（Akkermansia muciniphila）在多种肿瘤中被发现与良好疗效相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7be22ae5319dba5750804d5b451deaeb1824b2f0d34eadfa0efb356ec1d10424",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b749feba7530e5b0f51c3569": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b749feba7530e5b0f51c3569",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的发生",
        "finding": "irAEs的发生与特定的微生物组成有关。例如，厚壁菌门在某些研究中与高概率的irAEs相关，而在另一些研究中（如肝细胞癌）其高丰度可能具有保护作用。拟杆菌门在某些情况下与严重的irAEs（如结肠炎）相关。变形菌门、酸杆菌门（Acidobacteria）等在irAEs患者中富集。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7be22ae5319dba5750804d5b451deaeb1824b2f0d34eadfa0efb356ec1d10424",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::5a2cae410d9984e50db67838": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5a2cae410d9984e50db67838",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "微生物代谢产物",
        "finding": "有益代谢物如短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）、多糖A（PSA）、肌苷（inosine）可通过调节T细胞功能、抑制炎症或增强抗肿瘤免疫来促进ICI疗效。有害代谢物如脂多糖（LPS）、氨、酚类物质可能促进免疫逃逸或慢性炎症。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7be22ae5319dba5750804d5b451deaeb1824b2f0d34eadfa0efb356ec1d10424",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b6f20768b2887d10ea80e7ce": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b6f20768b2887d10ea80e7ce",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "粪菌移植（FMT）",
        "finding": "FMT在小样本临床试验和动物模型中显示出增强ICI疗效（如增加CD8+ T细胞浸润）和缓解难治性ICI相关结肠炎的潜力，但存在感染风险、供体选择异质性和长期效果不确定性等局限。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7be22ae5319dba5750804d5b451deaeb1824b2f0d34eadfa0efb356ec1d10424",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::831f74c18f6acbb460305b7d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::831f74c18f6acbb460305b7d",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::47345ccbe8245e9d66feb8970dbf53a3d3799fa941a6ea9963a76a8536cd8cb2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e9ee22d0d649cfdef88dfaa3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e9ee22d0d649cfdef88dfaa3",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "研究动机在于ICIs虽然显著改善了多种癌症患者的生存率，但响应率低（13%-69%）且伴随不可预测的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。现有证据表明肠道微生物群可能影响这些结果，但具体哪些微生物、通过何种机制影响疗效和毒性尚需系统总结，以便指导临床个性化治疗和开发新的干预策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2a835907f79d515a1e43b94e69beb17b6c5b685b7f4e39a93609ec3bf5eb34ec",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::54e701adaced0c19b2d494e0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::54e701adaced0c19b2d494e0",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在实体瘤治疗中的应用，聚焦于肠道微生物群对疗效和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响，以及粪菌移植（FMT）等干预手段。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::adcf0416fbeec7c18c59c05961ff1d8cef48ff9e166b4e74d05330fa7ff4fb26",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c7ad8027bdd3670be2e63b9e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c7ad8027bdd3670be2e63b9e",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇2023年发表的综述文章，旨在探讨肠道微生物群如何调节免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）的疗效和毒性。文章首先介绍了肠道微生物作为“隐藏器官”在维持肠道屏障和免疫监视中的作用，随后系统梳理了不同实体瘤（如转移性黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌、肝细胞癌等）中，特定细菌门类和物种与ICI疗效及irAEs发生的相关性。文章还讨论了微生物代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸、肌苷等）在介导免疫反应中的潜在机制，并总结了通过粪菌移植（FMT）、益生菌、益生元等手段调节肠道菌群以增强疗效或减轻毒性的临床进展与挑战。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0b99383661cd623ae8f49b6a8be57c599861c50977033e232a8abd2713415b89",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::00d7c7c6c40983445a6d917b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::00d7c7c6c40983445a6d917b",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物群如何影响ICI疗效和毒性提供了全面的背景知识和证据汇总。它特别适用于构建综述中关于‘微生物群落特征与临床结局关联’的部分，以及讨论‘微生态干预策略（如FMT）’的章节。文中提供的详细细菌门类/物种列表及其在不同癌症类型中的表现，可作为跨论文比较的基础素材。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::feab8f8d1430b7bb73fc1e9f8db68753f102bd7101372eb581bda5e7c0099aa5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6b6fd4c90a28730f2eb6373e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6b6fd4c90a28730f2eb6373e",
      "source_handle": "P0231",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些关联主要基于观察性研究，存在方法学差异和混杂因素，不能直接确立因果关系。不同研究间结果可能存在矛盾（如拟杆菌门的作用），需结合具体研究条件解读。",
        "contribution": "提供了不同实体瘤类型中，与ICI疗效（响应/无响应）相关的特定肠道微生物门类及代表性菌种的详细列表。例如，指出厚壁菌门和放线菌门中的某些菌常与疗效正相关，而变形菌门常与无响应相关。同时列出了与irAEs发生相关的微生物特征。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::ab105c805d6f74d4e02b550bd32c388cfdb4a08fa19df751c19b0df850fc9883",
          "field_path": [
