    },
    "atom::00a19ae4aaf57c17faf6d44e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::00a19ae4aaf57c17faf6d44e",
      "source_handle": "P0357",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用系统性文献综合路线。首先梳理肠道微生物组调节局部及全身免疫的基础生物学机制（受体信号通路、表观遗传调控）。其次，分类汇总临床前研究（主要是小鼠模型），分析特定菌株对树突状细胞、T细胞极化及肿瘤微环境的影响。再次，系统检索并归纳人类临床研究数据，包括回顾性队列、前瞻性观察研究及I/II期临床试验，按癌种（肺癌、肾癌、黑色素瘤等）和治疗类型进行分层分析。最后，结合专家观点与现有文献缺口，提出整合多组学、体外功能 assay 及标准化临床试验的未来研究框架。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd944d8134d501566e942ca006ee36320ec01cc920f6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a64fb791241d785928d4e9b0f5c82b9b73ef68270",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7d547f64447ce3b37175b7de0144b51eec8bbc8fc7eb20409c105ec0345fbf9f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::71d806cb03a92d98e2986d9d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::71d806cb03a92d98e2986d9d",
      "source_handle": "P0357",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了益生菌增强ICI疗效的多层次机制全景图，连接了微生物代谢物、免疫细胞亚群及肿瘤微环境重塑。",
        "limits": "机制部分主要基于小鼠模型，其外推至人类的适用性受限；人类数据多为观察性，存在选择偏倚和混杂因素。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd944d8134d501566e942ca006ee36320ec01cc920f6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a64fb791241d785928d4e9b0f5c82b9b73ef68270",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6117d79020ce6b270b108324313232500f6f5cd2419ebc8d92bc9af3751c7528",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9d832b25167ebcddca09a6b4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9d832b25167ebcddca09a6b4",
      "source_handle": "P0357",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "系统整理了截至2025年的临床前及早期临床证据，揭示了不同癌种和益生菌类型的响应差异。",
        "limits": "临床数据异质性高，难以得出统一的疗效结论；缺乏长期安全性和长期定植效果的数据。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd944d8134d501566e942ca006ee36320ec01cc920f6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a64fb791241d785928d4e9b0f5c82b9b73ef68270",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6117d79020ce6b270b108324313232500f6f5cd2419ebc8d92bc9af3751c7528",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::33a9645f6cef26721b0123d6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::33a9645f6cef26721b0123d6",
      "source_handle": "P0357",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "明确了当前领域的关键瓶颈（标准化缺失、监管障碍、因果推断困难），并为未来研究设计了方法论框架。",
        "limits": "作为综述，未提供新的原始实验数据；提出的未来方向需后续实证研究验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd944d8134d501566e942ca006ee36320ec01cc920f6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a64fb791241d785928d4e9b0f5c82b9b73ef68270",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6117d79020ce6b270b108324313232500f6f5cd2419ebc8d92bc9af3751c7528",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::302a80f9ec357636e98d3b23": {
      "atom_id": "atom::302a80f9ec357636e98d3b23",
      "source_handle": "P0357",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "临床前小鼠模型（黑色素瘤、结直肠癌等）",
        "finding": "特定益生菌（如双歧杆菌、乳酸杆菌、Clostridium butyricum、Akkermansia muciniphila）可通过激活树突状细胞、促进MHC-I抗原呈递、调节细胞因子谱（增加IFN-γ, TNF-α）、诱导巨噬细胞向M1型极化以及产生SCFAs等代谢物，增强CD8+ T细胞浸润和活性，从而协同ICI发挥抗肿瘤作用。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd944d8134d501566e942ca006ee36320ec01cc920f6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a64fb791241d785928d4e9b0f5c82b9b73ef68270",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::15292636087448156c21e88f3eaba99cd11d3f6cae6e1c4978479aefe5e05343",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0ff7bc74c4a0e8a80d1f6f4d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0ff7bc74c4a0e8a80d1f6f4d",
      "source_handle": "P0357",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "人类回顾性及前瞻性观察研究（非小细胞肺癌、转移性肾细胞癌、黑色素瘤）",
        "finding": "多项研究显示，使用益生菌（尤其是Clostridium butyricum MIYAIRI 588或多种混合菌株）与改善无进展生存期（PFS）和总生存期（OS）相关。例如，在一项NSCLC回顾性研究中，益生菌使用者中位PFS显著延长；在mRCC的前瞻性研究中，CBM588联合nivolumab/ipilimumab显示出更高的客观缓解率（ORR）和PFS。然而，部分商业益生菌补充剂在非标准化使用时可能无效甚至有害。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd944d8134d501566e942ca006ee36320ec01cc920f6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a64fb791241d785928d4e9b0f5c82b9b73ef68270",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::15292636087448156c21e88f3eaba99cd11d3f6cae6e1c4978479aefe5e05343",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::3126473c4fbc3a92dfe180c6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3126473c4fbc3a92dfe180c6",
      "source_handle": "P0357",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）管理",
        "finding": "某些益生菌株（如Bifidobacterium spp., Lactobacillus spp.）在动物模型中可减轻ICI诱导的结肠炎。在人类观察性研究中，较高的有益菌丰度或与irAEs风险降低相关，但临床数据不一致，部分研究显示益生菌使用并未增加irAEs发生率，而在联合化疗时可能增加特定毒性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd944d8134d501566e942ca006ee36320ec01cc920f6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::6e75af540e1165fa53a1929a64fb791241d785928d4e9b0f5c82b9b73ef68270",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::15292636087448156c21e88f3eaba99cd11d3f6cae6e1c4978479aefe5e05343",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::30453997df29189781838b94": {
      "atom_id": "atom::30453997df29189781838b94",
      "source_handle": "P0357",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "方法学与标准化现状",
        "finding": "大多数临床证据来自回顾性研究，缺乏随机对照试验（RCT）。使用的益生菌制剂高度异质化（单株vs多株，商业补充剂vs定义明确的菌株），且受饮食、抗生素使用、种族等混杂因素影响严重。目前尚无法确定最佳菌株、剂量及给药方案。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1e84d153ee9b84bcfe58dd944d8134d501566e942ca006ee36320ec01cc920f6",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
