    "atom::0650dc0b918fba639db74764": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0650dc0b918fba639db74764",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用“临床观察+动物因果验证”的两阶段设计。第一阶段为横断面观察：收集32例irAE患者粪便，通过16S rDNA测序分析菌群组成（PCoA, LEfSe）及功能预测，对比结肠炎型（n=8）与非结肠炎型（n=24）患者的差异。第二阶段为体内因果实验：建立抗生素清除小鼠肠道菌群模型，分别移植结肠炎型和非结肠炎型患者的粪便菌群，随后给予双免疫检查点阻断（抗PD-1 + 抗CTLA-4）治疗，监测小鼠体重、疾病活动指数（DAI）、组织学评分及免疫细胞浸润情况，以评估供体菌群对受体结肠炎发生的影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2e861e5987b3aaacf060fd0b114459519fac3dedff042d5ea68795abcca58163",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::66d76f5eb5b3514b53450f1c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::66d76f5eb5b3514b53450f1c",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了ICIs相关结肠炎患者与健康对照（非结肠炎irAE）之间肠道菌群特征的详细图谱，识别出特定的风险菌群标志物（如低拟杆菌/双歧杆菌，高肠球菌）和功能改变（产丁酸菌减少）。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代人类队列的基线特征匹配情况、测序深度细节及多重检验校正方法；小鼠实验仅报告了部分死亡个体的极端数据，未提供所有个体的完整分布统计，且样本量较小（每组9只），可能限制结果的稳健性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4cce9d8039074c1569e534b071f7135e426dab697c4cc208faa3e320904703ea",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::1f06e9ea92ea153bace4387c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1f06e9ea92ea153bace4387c",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "通过FMT实验在动物模型中建立了肠道菌群与ICIs诱导结肠炎之间的因果联系，表明特定的人类菌群具有致结肠炎潜力。",
        "limits": "动物模型无法完全模拟人类复杂的免疫系统和肿瘤微环境；FMT实验仅使用了单一时间点的供体菌群，未考虑菌群动态变化；摘要未说明是否排除了其他宿主因素（如基因背景、饮食）对结果的干扰。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4cce9d8039074c1569e534b071f7135e426dab697c4cc208faa3e320904703ea",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::768a0afe5a7442dbc6d309fa": {
      "atom_id": "atom::768a0afe5a7442dbc6d309fa",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "人类队列比较：8例结肠炎型irAE vs 24例非结肠炎型irAE患者",
        "finding": "菌群组成存在显著差异（Adonis P=0.003）。结肠炎型患者中拟杆菌门（Bacteroidota）和双歧杆菌属（Bifidobacterium）丰度较低，而变形菌门（Proteobacteria）和肠球菌属（Enterococcus）丰度较高。主要产丁酸菌总丰度在结肠炎型患者中显著降低（P=0.018）。功能预测显示环境信息处理、遗传信息处理及代谢通路存在差异。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2a10353197ad03d3cdabd79c85da36069a274d08c3fdfcfa052975245b8436d9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::bff31da88cca7e46ed16f5f7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bff31da88cca7e46ed16f5f7",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "小鼠FMT实验：抗生素预处理小鼠接受结肠炎型（Colitic-irAE-FMT）或非结肠炎型（Non-irAE-FMT）患者菌群移植，随后联合抗PD-1/抗CTLA-4治疗",
        "finding": "9只Colitic-irAE-FMT小鼠中有3只发展为致命性严重结肠炎，而9只Non-irAE-FMT小鼠全部存活且无结肠炎（P=0.052）。死亡小鼠表现出更快的体重下降和更高的DAI评分。组织学评分显示，死亡小鼠（14分）显著高于非结肠炎组（3.89 ± 1.17）和存活结肠炎组（3.67 ± 1.03）。免疫组化显示死亡小鼠CD8+、CD4+和CD20+细胞浸润较高，支持免疫介导的结肠炎发生。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2a10353197ad03d3cdabd79c85da36069a274d08c3fdfcfa052975245b8436d9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fd96b7055d5fee07ab697ea2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fd96b7055d5fee07ab697ea2",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "empirical",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::fec61e37bd04f63fc81c41ae4aba6cd78e73a42e5d728346787aab8dcde9c097",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::0cb9249a1bedc5d665819a64": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0cb9249a1bedc5d665819a64",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物群影响ICIs的疗效，但其如何影响免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），特别是ICIs相关结肠炎的发生机制尚不清楚。本研究试图明确肠道微生物组与ICIs相关结肠炎之间的关联性及因果联系。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::08ee5391848489df7a408309a93643443f000a991353c8bf60337f6be16cb1de",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::794e1f1d3aff4d81c94882d9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::794e1f1d3aff4d81c94882d9",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究对象为接受抗PD-1治疗的晚期恶性肿瘤患者及其衍生模型。研究聚焦于免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）引发的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），具体限定在结肠炎型irAE（colitic irAE）与非结肠炎型irAE之间的差异，以及肠道微生物组在其中的作用。样本包括32例人类粪便样本和通过粪菌移植（FMT）构建的小鼠模型。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::40f8df160bbee37e5adf499e99416d32cde275815e8b58b972fd3f887b89d825",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::23279ff6e33de3360f4f34ab": {
      "atom_id": "atom::23279ff6e33de3360f4f34ab",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探索肠道微生物组与ICIs相关结肠炎之间的关联及因果关系。研究首先收集了32名在接受抗PD-1治疗后出现irAE的晚期肿瘤患者的粪便样本，利用Illumina MiSeq平台进行16S rDNA扩增子测序。通过比较8名结肠炎型irAE患者与24名非结肠炎型irAE患者的菌群特征，发现两者在门、属水平及功能通路上的显著差异。随后，研究将来自结肠炎型和非结肠炎型患者的粪便样本分别移植给抗生素处理过的小鼠，并联合使用抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4抗体进行治疗。结果显示，接受结肠炎型患者菌群移植的小鼠出现了严重的致死性结肠炎，而非结肠炎型患者菌群移植的小鼠均存活且无结肠炎症状，从而在动物模型中验证了特定肠道菌群对ICIs相关结肠炎的致病潜力。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::930530d9072cbe085a2a2da26ba31849b89a5f72051d79257fd52ef044026614",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3b1b6cd5f67aa17e67c1929f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3b1b6cd5f67aa17e67c1929f",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物组如何介导ICIs不良反应（特别是结肠炎）的关键实证素材。其核心价值在于不仅描述了相关性，还通过FMT实验初步证实了因果性，并指出了具体的菌群标志物（如产丁酸菌缺失、肠球菌富集）和潜在机制线索（代谢通路改变）。这有助于解释为何部分患者会出现严重的irAEs，并为后续探讨菌群调控机制提供具体的分子和生态学靶点。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7172015b0dab6859c834058322109ca5f94f335583523e0cf14212983565c409",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fd8e86eda99541c73ae9e6c6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fd8e86eda99541c73ae9e6c6",
      "source_handle": "P0017",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅针对结肠炎这一特定irAE类型，不直接回答菌群对肿瘤缩小（efficacy）的直接调节机制，需结合其他研究综合判断。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道菌群失调与ICIs疗效/安全性关联的具体表型证据。指出结肠炎型患者特有的菌群特征（低拟杆菌/双歧杆菌，高肠球菌），可作为评估ICIs治疗风险的生物标志物参考。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::8b8d965f22f748d8aea311269a6f0e2a9da275cc0c6a988a124e0c1cb0c546a2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
