    "atom::873653225ac3d94f9fee6560": {
      "atom_id": "atom::873653225ac3d94f9fee6560",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用多阶段混合方法：1) 数据整合与预处理：从公共数据库提取7项研究的16S数据，结合内部收集的16S和宏基因组数据；使用MMUPHin算法对“研究”这一主要混杂因素进行批次校正。2) 差异分析与特征筛选：使用阻塞Wilcoxon秩和检验识别差异物种，排除与疗效（response）重叠的特征，保留irAEs特异性特征。3) 机器学习建模：使用随机森林（Random Forest）算法，通过迭代特征消除（IFE）优化，筛选出最具判别力的14个微生物特征构建RF14分类器。4) 模型评估：通过分层十折交叉验证、留一法验证（LOSO）及两个独立外部队列（SH和JS队列）评估模型性能（AUC、敏感性、特异性等）。5) 机制探索：利用PICRUSt2预测功能，结合宏基因组数据验证关键基因（menH, menC）表达，并通过qRT-PCR和HPLC-MS/MS定量粪便样本中的基因丰度和血清中的甲萘醌水平；最后结合结肠组织转录组数据进行GSEA分析以推断炎症通路机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::07617559e8ca2ea4c286a693fdc4fa6d8d644b58f8009f1b65179987f60ddb10",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::24339fdba7a3beeae5bb9d0b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::24339fdba7a3beeae5bb9d0b",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了一个经过严格外部验证的、基于14种微生物的irAEs预测模型（RF14），解决了既往研究结果不一致的问题，并指出了特定微生物（如乳酸杆菌）作为潜在生物标志物的价值。",
        "limits": "机制部分主要基于观察性数据的关联分析和文献推导，缺乏直接的体内或体外实验证实甲萘醌对irAEs的具体因果作用；样本量虽经整合但仍有限，且未完全控制所有临床混杂因素（如抗生素使用细节、具体肿瘤类型差异等）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::95f9c649a6976d02db19a9160574d719d33951230c298507065bd3a7eb3157a0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6e3aea46111b008f2e807480": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6e3aea46111b008f2e807480",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "整合3项大规模anti-PD-1/PD-L1队列（n=190）进行训练",
        "finding": "识别出14种微生物特征构成的RF14分类器，区分irAEs与非irAEs的平均AUC为0.88；其中Lactobacillus salivarius为排名最高的生物标志物。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e8cde35c3d51bc7a75cf39a14ca4ae8e648c39f11898eea832c904d8ea704b62",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0c8da7cfe4b7d6b35e1263aa": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0c8da7cfe4b7d6b35e1263aa",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "两个独立外部队列验证（SH队列N=65，JS队列N=50）",
        "finding": "RF14分类器在两个独立队列中均显示出显著的判别能力，证明了模型的跨队列泛化性和稳健性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e8cde35c3d51bc7a75cf39a14ca4ae8e648c39f11898eea832c904d8ea704b62",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::df9a4cb408e8af81702d5567": {
      "atom_id": "atom::df9a4cb408e8af81702d5567",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "功能分析与代谢物检测",
        "finding": "非irAEs患者肠道微生物中甲萘醌（Menaquinone/Vitamin K2）生物合成途径显著富集，关键限速酶menH和menC表达升高；血清中甲萘醌水平在非irAEs患者中显著高于irAEs患者。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e8cde35c3d51bc7a75cf39a14ca4ae8e648c39f11898eea832c904d8ea704b62",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b1e8085158f4858a558996ef": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b1e8085158f4858a558996ef",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "机制推断（结合转录组数据）",
        "finding": "低RF评分（高风险irAEs）组患者结肠组织中促炎通路（如NF-κB信号通路）显著激活；文献支持甲萘醌可抑制NF-κB通路，提示微生物来源的甲萘醌可能通过抗炎机制保护宿主免受irAEs损伤。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e8cde35c3d51bc7a75cf39a14ca4ae8e648c39f11898eea832c904d8ea704b62",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cf3ef56f614496fc53563362": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cf3ef56f614496fc53563362",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "empirical",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ac686d4080e67d5d97e1f011408d6d60746fab81d4a8824c4bda746156296ca5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f284a3f55120c4d9be9d82b8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f284a3f55120c4d9be9d82b8",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICIs引发的irAEs，但不同研究报道的微生物关联存在不一致性，缺乏高鲁棒性的预测生物标志物及明确的机制解释。本研究试图回答：能否从整合数据中识别出稳定预测anti-PD-1/PD-L1治疗相关irAEs的微生物特征？这些微生物特征背后的功能机制是什么？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9a1679cc72b99079675114cfb8a65ed5e8f7b884eb8ce98a5837bea7909e84c9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9f268b67ab84227a5bde91fa": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9f268b67ab84227a5bde91fa",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "接受抗PD-1/PD-L1免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗的实体瘤患者；研究聚焦于基线肠道微生物组与免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）发生风险之间的关联，以及潜在的代谢机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::09eb4b87e62f306f23bbe9483be15431eaad1ada9ea0919dabf380b42639376d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6a632fec1bedc7f321c9802b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6a632fec1bedc7f321c9802b",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在解决现有研究中肠道微生物组与irAEs关联不一致的问题，通过整合公开数据与内部队列，构建基于机器学习的微生物预测模型并探索其生物学机制。研究团队收集了来自7项已发表研究的317名患者的16S rRNA测序数据，以及来自上海和徐州两家医院的115名患者的内部队列数据（包括16S和宏基因组）。首先，通过元分析校正“研究”带来的批次效应，识别出区分irAEs与非irAEs的特异性微生物特征。随后，利用随机森林算法筛选出14种关键微生物物种，构建了RF14分类器，在训练集上达到0.88的AUC，并在两个独立外部队列中验证了其稳健性。此外，研究结合转录组与宏基因组数据，发现非irAEs患者肠道中维生素K2（甲萘醌/menaquinone）的生物合成途径及关键酶（menH, menC）表达显著升高，且血清中甲萘醌水平更高。机制推测表明，微生物来源的甲萘醌可能通过抑制NF-κB等促炎信号通路来减轻irAEs的发生。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2a7cbe9c6bc3bce9521f051fa29e778df7426136c277770f668feea9e849a3fd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::727e374e4ed1d8e07bdc4c4f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::727e374e4ed1d8e07bdc4c4f",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物组如何调节ICIs疗效副作用（irAEs）的重要实证素材。它不仅贡献了一个具有较高预测性能的微生物特征面板（RF14），还深入探讨了具体的代谢机制（甲萘醌/NF-κB通路），这有助于在综述中解释微生物组影响免疫毒性的潜在分子路径，并为讨论预防策略提供依据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d4589ea047fccb924c9cac0addb71867daf4d005f3b5692765c08f3133883e2c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3f5d7b9532842831db5ba214": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3f5d7b9532842831db5ba214",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该模型主要针对anti-PD-1/PD-L1治疗，对于anti-CTLA-4或其他联合疗法的适用性需参考文中提到的其他数据集或保持谨慎外推。",
        "contribution": "提供了基于14种微生物特征的irAEs预测模型（RF14），显示非irAEs患者中特定菌属（如Lactobacillus, Parabacteroides）富集。这直接回应了微生物组如何影响ICIs安全性（毒性）的问题，表明特定的微生物组成可以作为风险分层工具。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::24f61000473bbfc048efc85517bc8a93987ac90b21f7cf1b6845e08043e189e1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::41ec607a4aaa04f93a8a926a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::41ec607a4aaa04f93a8a926a",
      "source_handle": "P0308",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中讨论微生物组作为irAEs预测生物标志物的可行性，列举具体的预测模型及其性能指标（AUC 0.88），并对比不同研究间的异质性。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84257ddd41cae6b95446b25f99102db710c36f64d7",
