    "atom::6448e9e5b0208bc6be940ba3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6448e9e5b0208bc6be940ba3",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "作为一篇综述，本研究采用文献综述的方法，对已发表的关于ICIs诱导的irAEs预测生物标志物的研究进行系统性整理和归纳。具体路线包括：1. 将潜在生物标志物按类别进行分类（血液细胞计数/表面标记、血清蛋白、自身抗体、细胞因子/趋化因子、遗传变异/基因表达、HLA基因型、microRNAs、肠道微生物组及其他如BMI）。2. 针对每一类，提取并总结代表性研究的设计类型（回顾性或前瞻性）、样本量、肿瘤类型、具体的生物标志物指标、观察到的关联方向（正相关或负相关）以及统计学显著性。3. 对比不同研究间结果的异同，特别关注矛盾发现。4. 综合讨论各类标志物的临床可行性、特异性问题（如受癌症本身炎症影响）及机制解释。5. 基于现有证据的整体质量，评估其向临床转化所需的条件（如需要更多前瞻性验证）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8a3a92623340459e71e459546e5045099505d7cce49d1a388b61193f227e1f69",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::eb2b8fbc4af35b9b2c9ca1f2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::eb2b8fbc4af35b9b2c9ca1f2",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了关于ICIs诱导irAEs预测生物标志物的全面分类综述，涵盖了从常规实验室检测到前沿分子特征的广泛领域。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及偏倚风险评估方法，仅呈现了作者的归纳观点。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::82e3c66caf581a0dea8fa0d9cb934de31de69b2b9864bbb03191ad83f5da6caf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::05791142a284303824abe255": {
      "atom_id": "atom::05791142a284303824abe255",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "明确指出了当前生物标志物研究的主要局限性：结果不一致、缺乏特异性（受肿瘤炎症干扰）、多为回顾性研究、以及缺乏临床实用性的验证。",
        "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究的质量和设计，无法提供新的实证数据。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::82e3c66caf581a0dea8fa0d9cb934de31de69b2b9864bbb03191ad83f5da6caf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ac0eba0a8b72df7ef1d376ab": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ac0eba0a8b72df7ef1d376ab",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提出了生物标志物可能同时预测irAE风险和抗肿瘤疗效的假设，为未来研究方向提供了思路。",
        "limits": "该假设尚需更多研究证实，目前仅是基于个别研究的推测。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::82e3c66caf581a0dea8fa0d9cb934de31de69b2b9864bbb03191ad83f5da6caf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9c2ff752cd56f38240a96868": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9c2ff752cd56f38240a96868",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "血液细胞计数与比率（回顾性为主，多肿瘤类型）",
        "finding": "多项回顾性研究显示基线或治疗期间的白细胞、中性粒细胞、淋巴细胞、嗜酸性粒细胞、单核细胞及其比值（如NLR, PLR）与irAEs风险存在关联，但结果高度不一致。例如，部分研究发现低基线淋巴细胞计数预示高风险，而其他研究则发现高计数或治疗后升高与风险相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::136285dee854453301916ddfe556375184ec38efb1c34cdda0c2724d442d5962",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c55bb20d1969796d60d640a6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c55bb20d1969796d60d640a6",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "血清蛋白（CRP, LDH, Albumin等）",
        "finding": "C反应蛋白（CRP）的研究结果矛盾：有的显示irAE发作时短暂升高，有的显示基线低水平与irAE发生独立相关。其他蛋白如LDH和白蛋白也显示出不一致的结果。器官特异性蛋白（如心肌酶谱、甲状腺激素）在特定irAEs中显示出较好的相关性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::136285dee854453301916ddfe556375184ec38efb1c34cdda0c2724d442d5962",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9d3d6d15e8c760a46b53e081": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9d3d6d15e8c760a46b53e081",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "自身抗体（ANA, 甲状腺抗体等）",
        "finding": "基线存在自身抗体（如ANA、抗甲状腺抗体）可能与某些irAEs（如内分泌功能障碍）的风险增加有关，但也有一些研究未发现这种关联，甚至发现基线抗体滴度较低者反而风险更高。自身抗体可能更多反映预先存在的自身免疫倾向而非直接预测新发irAEs。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::136285dee854453301916ddfe556375184ec38efb1c34cdda0c2724d442d5962",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f4e705878e96a2a175972cf1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f4e705878e96a2a175972cf1",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "细胞因子/趋化因子（IL-1, IL-6, IL-10, CXCL9等）",
        "finding": "多种促炎和抗炎细胞因子与irAEs相关，但方向不一。例如，IL-6基线高水平在某些研究中是风险因素，而在另一项黑色素瘤研究中低风险与高irAE发生率相关。CXCL9/CXCL10等趋化因子在治疗后升高与irAEs发生相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::136285dee854453301916ddfe556375184ec38efb1c34cdda0c2724d442d5962",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9202f18ba63842bbe31e8043": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9202f18ba63842bbe31e8043",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "基因变异与表达（SNPs, HLA, miRNAs）",
        "finding": "特定基因多态性（如PDCD1, SYK, IL7）和HLA基因型（如HLA-DRB1*11:01与瘙痒，HLA-DQB1*03:01与结肠炎）与特定irAEs风险相关，但不同研究间存在冲突（如HLA-DQB1*03:01对结肠炎的保护或易感作用）。miRNA（如miR-146a）在严重irAEs中表达降低，但研究数量较少。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "4"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::136285dee854453301916ddfe556375184ec38efb1c34cdda0c2724d442d5962",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ad2193d5428b989ee801e640": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ad2193d5428b989ee801e640",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "肠道微生物组",
        "finding": "肠道菌群组成与irAEs有关联，但结果不一致且难以复现。例如，Agathobacter丰度降低在某些研究中与irAEs相关，而在另一些研究中与更严重的irAEs相关。粪便样本采集困难限制了其广泛应用。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "5"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::136285dee854453301916ddfe556375184ec38efb1c34cdda0c2724d442d5962",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f4ee43ed31aa893dc3ef1d24": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f4ee43ed31aa893dc3ef1d24",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d75c8baaf9ab2358ce9bf241fb0cf053a41df3a19a6f3a491f854ddc32b4cc45",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a05eb717b269685717335fe6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a05eb717b269685717335fe6",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "当前ICIs治疗中，由于irAEs的发生具有多样性、不可预测性和严重性，且可能影响治疗连续性和患者生活质量，临床急需有效的预测生物标志物以实现早期识别和干预。然而，现有研究中提出的众多潜在生物标志物结果不一致，且缺乏临床实用性。因此，本研究旨在回答：目前有哪些潜在的生物标志物被提出用于预测irAEs？它们的证据强度如何？存在哪些主要局限性和不一致性？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c57bfb61f30ab003d9aa5179894b4f645aa4053247361a5e8f1579a1b6c29f4d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::874ec0197cd7611fd1abbf91": {
      "atom_id": "atom::874ec0197cd7611fd1abbf91",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗的癌症患者，重点关注预测和管理免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的生物标志物。涵盖多种肿瘤类型（如黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌等），涉及血液学指标、血清蛋白、自身抗体、细胞因子/趋化因子、基因变异、基因表达谱、HLA基因型、microRNAs及肠道微生物组等多个维度的潜在生物标志物。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ab45f53b1e1efa7ec7f8464ad4b7f8d10908064e1236fdc2308ff96680a35cca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::647e35c3c5f2baefcc16e580": {
      "atom_id": "atom::647e35c3c5f2baefcc16e580",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在系统梳理和评估目前用于预测和管理ICIs治疗期间发生的irAEs的各种潜在生物标志物。文章首先介绍了irAEs的临床背景及其对治疗的影响，随后分类详细讨论了各类生物标志物的研究现状、关联发现及局限性。作者指出，尽管已有大量研究探索了从常规血液检测到复杂分子特征的多种标志物，但由于研究结果的不一致性、缺乏特异性以及多为回顾性研究的局限，目前尚无经过充分验证并可用于常规临床实践的单一或组合生物标志物。文章最后强调了未来需要大规模前瞻性研究来验证这些标志物的效力，并探讨了生物标志物在同时预测irAE风险和抗肿瘤疗效方面的潜力。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::956f369a14aae581a3fc6dab9f0cf7f1a7575ebf8331223427f89648d5300895",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c59386d914d9945cb8700e26": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c59386d914d9945cb8700e26",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解ICIs治疗中irAEs的生物标志物提供了广泛的背景知识和分类框架。虽然它不直接回答肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤中ICIs疗效的具体机制（这是Facet F1/F2的核心），但它提供了关键的对照信息：即除了微生物组外，宿主免疫状态（血液细胞、细胞因子、基因型）也被广泛研究用于预测irAEs。这有助于在综述中构建一个更全面的“宿主-药物-微生物”互作模型，或者用于比较微生物组标志物与其他类型标志物在预测能力、特异性和临床可行性上的差异。此外，文中提到的微生物组研究结果的不一致性和可重复性问题，可作为讨论微生物组作为生物标志物挑战性的有力论据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::06691015561f5c8f17bf85af4cca0f99c3c8f11eb2882209722b377c60ad9a4c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c48d388bf7a8a44d386d7518": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c48d388bf7a8a44d386d7518",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该综述并未深入探讨微生物组调节ICIs疗效的具体分子机制，也未专门聚焦于实体瘤中微生物组与药物疗效的直接因果链条，而是将其置于irAEs预测的 broader context 中。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组作为irAEs预测生物标志物的现状概述，包括具体菌属（如Agathobacter）与irAEs关联的矛盾发现，以及粪便样本采集的挑战。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::47748e19afb1ea05e968f962d0fb6851c2ad0c688cbeeaaaf3e06c736e7f0b3d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6ca83de08ab4494a9c2df422": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6ca83de08ab4494a9c2df422",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于支持或反驳肠道微生物组在预测irAEs中的价值，特别是在讨论其临床可行性和结果一致性方面。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2177995fe8700a112831ab6ac61b2a2727d3462820d09cdfe9b1e777c801feab",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e837fdef16698a71a14bf2b4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e837fdef16698a71a14bf2b4",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "不能直接从本综述中提取微生物组调节免疫的具体机制细节，只能获得宏观层面的免疫参与线索。",
        "contribution": "虽然没有直接阐述微生物组的机制，但综述中提到的其他生物标志物（如T细胞受体多样性、细胞因子网络、HLA基因型）揭示了宿主免疫系统在irAEs发生中的核心作用。这间接提示，如果微生物组要影响irAEs，很可能也是通过调制宿主免疫反应（如T细胞激活、细胞因子释放）来实现的。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::47748e19afb1ea05e968f962d0fb6851c2ad0c688cbeeaaaf3e06c736e7f0b3d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::17c9c9785a3770c6dd3d3a80": {
      "atom_id": "atom::17c9c9785a3770c6dd3d3a80",
      "source_handle": "P0312",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可作为构建微生物组影响免疫反应的机制假说的背景参考。例如，可以推断微生物组可能通过类似途径（如改变T细胞库或细胞因子谱）来影响irAEs，从而引导对具体机制的搜索。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e5098f056730d4765c7de8193ab59efa3899aeb90af956a2b8a79daca85c8292",
          "field_path": [
