    "atom::779388869d52620ddc2b9af8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::779388869d52620ddc2b9af8",
      "source_handle": "P0601",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "鉴于 Bacillus sp. NRRL B-14911 被发现能诱导心脏自身免疫，但其作为病原体的生物学意义和致病机制尚不明确，本研究试图通过全基因组测序和表型分析来确定其物种身份、毒力潜力及遗传蓝图，以评估其作为自身免疫性心肌炎疾病模型的适用性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a3ce6157cdd1db2d54fcb611f08000dfabaa2f27bae9ef772a1d67142ab31cae",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c646a95d3c8893bf8182222ae70c68ec0a7a6f3a5000b29815bb4f8932c76490",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fd366c04592e4def2aee1e74": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fd366c04592e4def2aee1e74",
      "source_handle": "P0601",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究对象为海洋来源的细菌菌株 Bacillus sp. NRRL B-14911（后鉴定为 Bacillus infantis）。研究范围涵盖该菌株的全基因组测序、物种分类鉴定、毒力因子分析、生化代谢通路比较以及与近缘芽孢杆菌属物种的系统发育和基因组学对比。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a3ce6157cdd1db2d54fcb611f08000dfabaa2f27bae9ef772a1d67142ab31cae",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d04563a73b56032733e0ba10c8ce0d25baa38d4758e8a9eeba80f1780811ef65",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b276913d9e8956ce8f1d8319": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b276913d9e8956ce8f1d8319",
      "source_handle": "P0601",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在解析一种此前被报道能通过分子模拟诱导心脏自身免疫反应的海洋细菌 Bacillus sp. NRRL B-14911 的生物学特征。作者利用 PacBio RSII 长读长测序技术完成了该菌株的全基因组组装，并结合 16S rRNA 系统发育、ITS 序列分析、表型微阵列及 MALDI-TOF MS 等多维度手段将其确认为 Bacillus infantis 的一个新菌株。基因组分析揭示了其携带多种毒力因子、独特的甲基转移酶、转运蛋白及插入序列元件，并确认了其与心脏肌球蛋白重链 α 亚基具有分子模拟关系的尿素酰胺水解酶（AAH）基因的存在。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a3ce6157cdd1db2d54fcb611f08000dfabaa2f27bae9ef772a1d67142ab31cae",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5a8d0bcd0bd4094977a4d326c2a5d9f21b29e195e4611190dcb45c1360b1c53f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c127c2885ca8061d48cba8bb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c127c2885ca8061d48cba8bb",
      "source_handle": "P0601",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "论文指出分子模拟假说是导致自身免疫病（如心肌炎）的主要机制之一，并通过基因组数据证实了 B. infantis 携带相关模拟表位。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a3ce6157cdd1db2d54fcb611f08000dfabaa2f27bae9ef772a1d67142ab31cae",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::36c0bed6dc0ce85cd6567be984ddd0a41dc5ba6be07ec551a5e768c76f7d9ba6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
