    "atom::629bbd80be18fe5c807568c0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::629bbd80be18fe5c807568c0",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "locator"
      ],
      "value": {
        "writer_packet": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\planning\\writer_packets\\Ch6.json",
        "source_handle": "P0595",
        "card_path": "F:\\OptoMind-Review-2\\outputs\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\planning\\chapters\\external\\N64e929a3f9de2888bd6a-5a6b848383c152a3\\round_1\\supplements\\Ch6_gap_4\\attempt-adnnjw8w\\source_units\\SU01_search_candidate_9277696331\\card\\PAPER_READING_CARD.json"
      },
      "role": "metadata",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "locator"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1c2515d2096d5ca4be5f874dd11fb0f36b2da44fc11f0b4fde2f34a7b55c8736",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::cc78cfffe9a41d5a26e1f353": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cc78cfffe9a41d5a26e1f353",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用计算生物学/生物信息学分析路线。具体步骤包括：1. 数据获取与分组：从GEO数据库获取GSE180045（含三组临床表型）和GSE4172数据集；2. 差异分析与筛选：计算ICI-MC组相对于对照组的DEGs，并与已知免疫基因库交叉筛选得到IR-DEGs；3. 网络构建与核心基因识别：通过GO/KEGG/GSEA进行功能注释，构建PPI网络寻找Hub genes；4. 独立验证：在GSE4172中重复差异分析，与Hub genes取交集确定最优特征基因（OFGs）；5. 调控网络预测：构建miRNA-lncRNA-circRNA ceRNA网络；6. 药物预测：利用cMAP数据库进行小分子药物反向匹配。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a19556c6241a775c83e33ff1fa3f14464b16edf0fbe192c18640e762e8e6f0fb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7934629b27ce3ad1c3246313": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7934629b27ce3ad1c3246313",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "通过多数据集交叉验证，提出了NKG7、GZMH和KLRB1作为ICI-MC的关键候选免疫基因，并为理解ICI-MC中细胞毒性T细胞和NK细胞的激活提供了分子层面的证据。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代实验验证部分（如qPCR或Western Blot的具体条件及结果统计显著性）；仅基于公共转录组数据进行推断，缺乏体内或体外功能实验证实这些基因在心肌炎发生中的因果作用；药物预测仅为计算机模拟，未提供临床前或临床疗效验证。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8403f7a88ee489d80dad027bd1afcd27a619e4f0e1329eacbc0e97e75e897d07",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1998267a0aa1723cf7cda1c0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1998267a0aa1723cf7cda1c0",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "基于GSE180045数据集的比较分析",
        "finding": "鉴定出58个DEGs，其中32个为免疫相关基因（IR-DEGs）。功能富集显示这些基因主要参与细胞裂解、CD8+ T细胞受体信号通路、自然杀伤细胞介导的细胞毒性以及RAGE信号通路。上调的Hub基因包括IL7R, PRF1, GNLY, CD3G, NKG7, GZMH, GZMB, KLRB1, KLRK1, CD247。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::90b6cf7d84192e699a1a1905076d78fdec8f177501996008885f4022ffb1fdcb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::37879982c585e2c93bc24b9f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::37879982c585e2c93bc24b9f",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "基于GSE4172数据集的独立验证",
        "finding": "发现407个DEGs，与前述Hub基因的交集最终锁定3个最优特征基因（OFGs）：KLRB1, NKG7, GZMH。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::90b6cf7d84192e699a1a1905076d78fdec8f177501996008885f4022ffb1fdcb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6b01d9a7146588d2c4e324ba": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6b01d9a7146588d2c4e324ba",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "ceRNA网络与药物预测分析",
        "finding": "构建了包含靶miRNAs、lincRNAs和circRNAs的综合ceRNA网络。药物预测显示乙酰羟肟酸（acetohydroxamic-acid）具有最高的连接评分，提示在使用ICI治疗时应谨慎使用该类药物。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::90b6cf7d84192e699a1a1905076d78fdec8f177501996008885f4022ffb1fdcb",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::410db73ad835534fc76b4f61": {
