    },
    "atom::932461a494c5e75da8e3803d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::932461a494c5e75da8e3803d",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses",
        "purpose"
      ],
      "value": "提醒综述作者注意临床实践中药物-药物-免疫治疗相互作用的重要性，特别是在老年或多病共存人群中。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "broader_review_uses",
            "1",
            "purpose"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3e34035e641a31b3527e0267965446a16933e5f3166cc615e7c2643edbfd4b5e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::bcde895a5d0a9eb975f0dd3a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bcde895a5d0a9eb975f0dd3a",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅限于心肌炎这一特定器官毒性，不能直接外推至其他ICI相关免疫不良反应（如结肠炎、肺炎）的机制，尽管共享部分免疫通路。",
        "contribution": "提供了ICI-MC的具体分子机制细节：揭示了细胞毒性颗粒酶（GZMH, GZMB）和穿孔素相关蛋白（PRF1）、以及NK/T细胞表面受体（NKG7, KLRB1）的上调是ICI-MC的特征性改变。这有助于解释ICI如何通过增强效应细胞的细胞毒性功能导致心肌组织损伤。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::87806669b99296271af3fc965998265de417644961ce58ba81ad174648e1f2c9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6fdc31bce82e651db2d4e7c6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6fdc31bce82e651db2d4e7c6",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于综述中讨论ICI诱导的组织损伤机制，特别是区分肿瘤杀伤机制与自身免疫损伤机制的重叠部分。可作为“效应T细胞/NK细胞过度激活导致器官损伤”这一子话题的证据。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::044cb173212e35c1c6d6b229b265a81aa565a53e77c6762d85e16536c3a41752",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::56b597bf22b496baa3f9635a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::56b597bf22b496baa3f9635a",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "RAGE通路的具体上下游关系在摘要中未详细展开，需结合全文确认其在心肌炎中的具体角色。",
        "contribution": "指出了RAGE信号通路和炎症反应在ICI-MC中的作用，提示了除了直接的细胞毒性外，炎症信号传导也是重要机制。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::87806669b99296271af3fc965998265de417644961ce58ba81ad174648e1f2c9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cc46959ff77ff46c99be5732": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cc46959ff77ff46c99be5732",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "支持综述中关于“炎症微环境重塑”或“损伤相关分子模式（DAMPs）介导的免疫反应”的论述。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::044cb173212e35c1c6d6b229b265a81aa565a53e77c6762d85e16536c3a41752",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b388056f5106b7337e19df95": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b388056f5106b7337e19df95",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "本文未涉及肠道菌群数据，因此不能直接回答菌群如何调节ICI疗效的问题，只能作为机制研究的延伸背景。",
        "contribution": "虽然主要关注宿主免疫机制，但其发现的ceRNA网络和潜在药物靶点（如避免使用acetohydroxamic-acid）暗示了肠道菌群代谢产物可能通过影响宿主免疫基因表达进而影响ICI疗效或毒性的间接联系（尽管本文未直接研究菌群）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::87806669b99296271af3fc965998265de417644961ce58ba81ad174648e1f2c9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d2b071a30cea16bace631838": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d2b071a30cea16bace631838",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可作为背景材料，说明ICI毒性机制的复杂性，引出后续需要探讨宿主-微生物互作的必要性。或者作为反面/补充案例，说明仅关注宿主免疫基因可能忽略的其他调节层面。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::044cb173212e35c1c6d6b229b265a81aa565a53e77c6762d85e16536c3a41752",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2b15c67275699849f36d05e6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2b15c67275699849f36d05e6",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了ICI-MC这一特定严重不良事件（SAE）的分子机制线索，特别是强调了细胞毒性淋巴细胞（CD8+ T细胞和NK细胞）相关基因（如GZMH, NKG7, KLRB1）的核心地位。对于综述而言，它填补了ICI安全性机制中关于心脏特异性免疫反应的细节，可作为解释ICI如何引发非肿瘤组织自身免疫损伤的典型案例，特别是用于阐述“免疫过度激活”导致器官损伤的机制路径。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1509fb3167640585aacb47814b74d0cf75caf92f6461a422f9a4d373c6486f79",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::954abbf21f3f89330189e6dd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::954abbf21f3f89330189e6dd",
      "source_handle": "P0595",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究为纯生物信息学分析，发现的基因关联仅为统计学相关性，未经过湿实验验证其因果功能，引用时需明确其预测性质。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3f4c8dec02f81414a28625ade0beb1ba34d1cbb54b717e6ac5f1c667bd97525",
          "field_path": [
